# Upgrages

fertile-soil-name = Fertile Soil
fertile-soil-desc = Enriches the garden beds with minerals. Increases crop yield with each level.

growth-catalysts-name = Growth Catalysts
growth-catalysts-desc = A special watering formula that forces plants to develop faster. Reduces time to harvest.

catnip-infusion-name = Catnip Infusion
catnip-infusion-desc = A secret ingredient in the soil makes cats much happier when they visit your garden.

wholesale-supplies-name = Wholesale Supplies
wholesale-supplies-desc = We've arranged for shipments in big boxes! Reduces the cost of all future upgrades.

purr-profit-name = Purr Profit
purr-profit-desc = Boosts your overall cat happiness income. Happy cats bring more wealth!

over-blooming-name = Over Blooming
over-blooming-desc = Permanently multiplies crop yield from prestige rooms. Watch the garden explode!

unlock-tomato-name = Juicy Red Ball
unlock-tomato-desc = Your starting crop! Cats adore these bright red treats for their rich flavor and how fun they are to roll around.

unlock-cucumber-name = Crunchy Snack
unlock-cucumber-desc = Allows you to grow fresh cucumbers. Many cats love them for their juiciness and fun crunch!

unlock-corn-name = Sweet Kernels
unlock-corn-desc = Unlocks corn. These yellow kernels are a real treat that will make the cats purr with delight.

unlock-pumpkin-name = Festive Feast
unlock-pumpkin-desc = Allows you to feed the cats hearty pumpkins. It's the healthiest and grandest dish on your menu!

concentrated-nectar-name = Concentrated Nectar
concentrated-nectar-desc = Unlocks the Tomato's special trait. Constant care squeezes out the best! Each harvest click builds up a permanent cumulative yield bonus for all crops, and applies a x2 stronger effect specifically for Tomatoes.

tomato-bounty-name = Heavy Vines
tomato-bounty-desc = Strengthens the tomato vines so they can hold way more fruit. Every harvest yields a much larger amount of juicy red balls.

tomato-growth-name = Greenhouse Warmth
tomato-growth-desc = Creates the perfect cozy climate for your tomatoes. The sprouts absorb heat better and mature much faster.

tomato-joy-name = Gourmet Puree
tomato-joy-desc = Teaches you how to mash tomatoes into a smooth, delicious treat. Feeding this to your kittens fills them with ultimate happiness.

cucumber-bounty-name = Crisp Rows
cucumber-bounty-desc = Improves cucumber trellises for optimal layout. Every harvest yields a much larger amount of crunchy snacks.

cucumber-growth-name = Moisture Control
cucumber-growth-desc = Sets up automatic misting system for hydration. The cucumber sprouts absorb water better and mature much faster.

cucumber-joy-name = Chilled Slices
cucumber-joy-desc = Teaches you how to serve refreshing cold cucumber snacks. Feeding this to your kittens fills them with ultimate happiness.

corn-bounty-name = Heavy Ears
corn-bounty-desc = Feeds the roots with organic honey compost. The stalks produce heavy, oversized cobs packed with sweet juice.

corn-growth-name = Solar Mirrors
corn-growth-desc = Installs miniature mirrors around each pot. The sprouts soak up more warmth and ripen much faster.

corn-joy-name = Butter Glazed Nibbles
corn-joy-desc = Covers the fresh kernels with a warm, sweet glaze. Fluffy kittens start purring like engines just from the smell.

